>> Point := ବସ୍ତୁ ନୂତନ.
Point ଯେବେ: ['x-coordinate:'] କର: { :x ନିଜର x := x. }.
Point ଯେବେ: ['y-coordinate:'] କର: { :y ନିଜର y := y. }.
Point ଯେବେ: ['x-coordinate']  କର: { <- ନିଜର x ନକଲ. }.
Point ଯେବେ: ['y-coordinate']  କର: { <- ନିଜର y ନକଲ. }.

Point ଯେବେ: ['='] କର: { :other <- ( ନିଜର x = other x-coordinate
		 ଏବଂ: ନିଜର y = other y-coordinate ).
}.

>> pier := Point ନୂତନ x-coordinate: 5, y-coordinate: 6.
>> town-hall := Point ନୂତନ x-coordinate: 7, y-coordinate: 1.
>> restaurant := Point ନୂତନ x-coordinate: 5, y-coordinate: 6.

ଆଉଟପୁଟ୍ ଲେଖ: pier = town-hall, ନୂଆ-ଧାଡ଼ି.
ଆଉଟପୁଟ୍ ଲେଖ: pier = restaurant, ନୂଆ-ଧାଡ଼ି.
